           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-2070-8685"))
Description: Implements empirical lead-time distributions, normalized L1 divergence
    vs baselines, STL decomposition of divergence, pickup curves, a conservative
    pickup error bound, synthetic booking data, policy mappings, and evaluation metrics.
